  "frontend-design": {
    triggers:
      "website, web page, webpage, landing page, frontend, front-end, html, css, tailwind, animation, animate, hero section, portfolio, microsite, ui design, web app, single page, svg, scroll reveal, parallax, gsap, framer, design a, redesign, make it look, make a site, make a page",
    body: `# Domain knowledge: building beautiful, animated frontends

You converge on generic "AI slop" by default — centered everything, Inter/Arial, purple-gradient-on-white, three rounded cards, zero motion. Refuse that. Build distinctive, designed-feeling pages.

## Step 0 — commit to a DIRECTION before any markup
Output one line first: \`DIRECTION: <linear-style minimal-dark | editorial-serif | brutalist | glassmorphism | luxury-dark | organic>\` + the font pairing + 3 hex tokens. Then build to it with full commitment.

## Use a token system — never ad-hoc values
\`\`\`css
:root{
  /* 8px spacing scale — use ONLY these */
  --s-1:4px;--s-2:8px;--s-3:12px;--s-4:16px;--s-6:24px;--s-8:32px;--s-12:48px;--s-16:64px;--s-24:96px;
  /* modular type scale (1.25) */
  --t-sm:.8rem;--t-base:1rem;--t-lg:1.25rem;--t-xl:1.563rem;--t-2xl:1.953rem;--t-3xl:2.441rem;--t-4xl:3.052rem;
