- A global \`@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\` block whenever you animate.
- \`<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">\`, mobile-first responsive.
- \`:focus-visible\` rings, semantic HTML, real hover/\`:active\` states.
- Images: explicit width/height or aspect-ratio + \`loading="lazy"\` to kill layout shift.

After you ship a page, re-read it and score it against this list; fix anything that scores low before declaring done.`,
  },
};

